{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"runkin_hardwood_club","model_identifier":"runkin_hardwood_club","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"Hardwood club, about 0.75 m (26 u): knobbed head forward (-Z), sinew-wrapped grip at the origin. One-handed (runkin_clubber, slot_hand_r).\n\n## Set notes (from the equipment folder)\n\n# runkin_equipment\n\nStandalone copies of the A2 Runkin equipment (wood, flint, sinew and hide). Same geometry as the gear baked into runkin_archer / runkin_clubber / the villagers. One bbmodel per item; no clips.\n\n- `runkin_recurve_bow.bbmodel` (8 cubes): Recurve bow, about 1.2 m (43 u) tip to tip: sinew-wrapped grip, limbs bending toward the string, bone tips recurving away. Held in slot_hand_l: grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side (faces the archer when raised).\n- `runkin_hardwood_club.bbmodel` (4 cubes): Hardwood club, about 0.75 m (26 u): knobbed head forward (-Z), sinew-wrapped grip at the origin. One-handed (runkin_clubber, slot_hand_r).\n- `runkin_flint_spear.bbmodel` (3 cubes): Flint spear, 1.8 m (64 u): knapped flint point bound with sinew. Grip at the origin (20 u from the butt), point 44 u forward (-Z). Second grip for two-handed use (spear-fishing) 14 u forward of the main grip.\n- `runkin_hide_quiver.bbmodel` (2 cubes): Hide quiver with fletched arrows, 15 u tall. Origin = slot_hip_r (as worn by runkin_archer); also fits slot_quiver on the back.\n"},"description":"Hardwood club, about 0.75 m (26 u): knobbed head forward (-Z), sinew-wrapped grip at the origin. One-handed (runkin_clubber, slot_hand_r).\n\n## Set notes (from the equipment folder)\n\n# runkin_equipment\n\nStandalone copies of the A2 Runkin equipment (wood, flint, sinew and hide). Same geometry as the gear baked into runkin_archer / runkin_clubber / the villagers. One bbmodel per item; no clips.\n\n- `runkin_recurve_bow.bbmodel` (8 cubes): Recurve bow, about 1.2 m (43 u) tip to tip: sinew-wrapped grip, limbs bending toward the string, bone tips recurving away. Held in slot_hand_l: grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side (faces the archer when raised).\n- `runkin_hardwood_club.bbmodel` (4 cubes): Hardwood club, about 0.75 m (26 u): knobbed head forward (-Z), sinew-wrapped grip at the origin. One-handed (runkin_clubber, slot_hand_r).\n- `runkin_flint_spear.bbmodel` (3 cubes): Flint spear, 1.8 m (64 u): knapped flint point bound with sinew. Grip at the origin (20 u from the butt), point 44 u forward (-Z). Second grip for two-handed use (spear-fishing) 14 u forward of the main grip.\n- `runkin_hide_quiver.bbmodel` (2 cubes): Hide quiver with fletched arrows, 15 u tall. Origin = slot_hip_r (as worn by runkin_archer); also fits slot_quiver on the back.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"handle","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.75,-0.75,-14.0],"to":[0.75,0.75,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[17,22,18.5,23.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,20,17.0,21.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[19,22,20.5,23.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,22,17.0,23.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,1.5,17.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[2,0,3.5,17.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"47e3d708-5621-5907-b4ae-f2ad86b3b0f9"},{"name":"head","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,-1.5,-21.0],"to":[1.5,1.5,-14.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[15,17,18.0,20.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[24,0,31.0,3.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[18,17,21.0,20.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,17,7.0,20.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[4,0,7.0,7.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[7,0,10.0,7.0],"texture":0}}